{"ref":"BDB, גַּאֲוָה","hw":"גַּאֲוָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גַּאֲוָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. majesty, pride (</strong>cf. Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܰܐܝܽܘܬܳܐ</span> <strong>)</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Job 41:7\" href=\"/Job.41.7\">Jb 41:7</a> + 6 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּאֲוַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.23\">Pr 29:23</a> + 2 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּאֲוָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.3\">Is 13:3</a> + 8 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>rising up, swelling</em> of the sea <a data-ref=\"Psalms 46:4\" href=\"/Psalms.46.4\">ψ 46:4</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>majesty</em>, of Israel <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:29\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.29\">Dt 33:29</a>, Moab <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.6\">Is 16:6</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.29\">Je 48:29</a>, scales of crocodile <a data-ref=\"Job 41:7\" href=\"/Job.41.7\">Jb 41:7</a>, of God <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.26\">Dt 33:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:35\" href=\"/Psalms.68.35\">ψ 68:35</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>pride, haughtiness</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:2\" href=\"/Psalms.10.2\">ψ 10:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:19\" href=\"/Psalms.31.19\">31:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:24\" href=\"/Psalms.31.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 36:12\" href=\"/Psalms.36.12\">36:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:6\" href=\"/Psalms.73.6\">73:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.3\">Pr 14:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.23\">29:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.8\">Is 9:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.11\">13:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.11\">25:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עליזי גאותי</span> <em>my proudly exulting ones</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.3\">Is 13:3</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:11\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.11\">Zp 3:11</a>."